    "topic_id": 2567842,
    "poster_id": 524450,
    "post_rendered": "Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f84ba5284b311a66dd04f32ff5f63dd497acf765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f : \\mathbb{N} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" > such that for any two positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46ba6ed097cc88ded349bf99eea89817f135f470.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"34\" height=\"11\" > we have :<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/915d5bb93a27ef75ce204d690a8d8d92ae196a3b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"$$f(n)+1400m^2|n^2+f(f(m))$$\"  width=\"227\" height=\"19\" >",
    "post_canonical": "Find all functions $f : \\mathbb{N} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{N}$ such that for any two positive integers $m,n$ we have :\n$$f(n)+1400m^2|n^2+f(f(m))$$",
