    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 2569725,
    "poster_id": 524450,
    "post_rendered": "Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59b3c742da1f04d4585693e2c77c6bc0425bf6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f : \\mathbb{N} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" > such that for all triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" > of positive integers the following holds :<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3e757191fe4de6652a1abfc695c01c70a177082.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"$$f(ac)+f(bc)-f(c)f(ab) \\ge 1$$\"  width=\"234\" height=\"18\" ><br>\nProposed by <i>Mojtaba Zare</i>",
    "post_canonical": "Find all functions $f : \\mathbb{N} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$ such that for all triples $a,b,c$ of positive integers the following holds :\n\n$$f(ac)+f(bc)-f(c)f(ab) \\ge 1$$\n\nProposed by [i]Mojtaba Zare[/i]",
